99 at x 1960-1980, where the render's curb stands at y 351-364, so the mansard stops at about 6.9 m along the front, about where the sheet's cut begins (7.2 m); the corniced, crested head the earlier reading gave the second street dormer (x 1910-1990, cornice y 390-410) is likely that cut corner's own cornice and cresting turning back
